TITLE Mix 50 mmol/kg DIC + 50 mmol/kg Ca (1:1), heat 20 to 200 C, allow calcite ppt/diss

SOLUTION 1 DIC_endmember
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50

SOLUTION 2 Ca_endmember
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities Ca+2 CO3-2 HCO3- CO2
    -totals Ca C(4)

END
